<translate>
==== BodyLocation ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for clothing items. Indicates the part of the body that the item is worn on.
<syntaxhighlight lang='Java'>
BodyLocation = Hat,
</syntaxhighlight>

=== Body locations === <!--T:3-->

<!--T:4-->
The below table shows a list of all body locations, exclusive locations, and location models that are hidden when equipped.

<!--T:5-->
This information can be found in <code>media\lua\shared\NPCs\BodyLocations.lua</code>

<!--T:6-->
;Location: <code>BodyLocation</code> value used in item scripts.
;Lua constant: <code>ItemBodyLocation</code> constant used in Lua to reference this location.
;Exclusive locations: <code>BodyLocation</code> values that cannot be equipped together with this location.
;Hidden locations: <code>BodyLocation</code> models that are hidden when this location is equipped.

<!--T:7-->
